Description: polyICSFlow systematically identifies all cytokine combinations 
    detected in an intracellular cytokine staining (ICS) flow cytometry assay 
    and quantifies polyfunctional antigen-specific responses to single or 
    multiple antigens. The package also offers versatile plotting options for 
    efficient data exploration and visualization of cytokine co-expression 
    profiles.
